Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 06:22:39 +0000
Subject: Step 9 Phase A: production safety hardening

- Gate Base.metadata.create_all to non-production so Alembic is the sole
  schema owner in production (app/main.py)
- Make Twilio webhook verification fail closed behind an explicit dev-only
  TWILIO_SKIP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY flag, refused by validate_security in production
  (app/core/config.py, app/telephony/stream_auth.py)
- Disable /docs, /redoc and /openapi.json in production (app/main.py)
- Point .env.example DATABASE_URL at the compose 'db' service host
- Add tests for all four behaviours and update the two suites that relied on
  the old APP_ENV=development bypass
